  ('3', 3, false, 'W-2 payroll · A. September', '**Pay September on Mon 09-29 by Zelle (President only): revised total $6,750** — Grade 1 $2,000 · KG $1,000 · Pre-K teacher $750 (prorated from 09-22) · Pre-K assistant $1,000 · Qur''an $2,000 (President''s decision 2026-09-26: original amounts for September; October W-2 rates in QBO unchanged unless told). List with names: `records/16_Employees/01. Employee Details/2026-09-29_September_Contractor_Pay_List.md`. Check the …8048 balance and Zelle daily limit; get a one-line WhatsApp OK from Grade 1, Qur''an and the assistant; then Claude records the five payments in QBO with 1099 tracking', 'Muneeb (President) pays; Muneeb (accountant) records', '2026-09-29', '2026-09-29', 'Ready', null, now()),
  ('4', 4, false, 'W-2 payroll · A. September', 'Board minute for the W-2 decision + payroll budget — **five paid roles, $12,000/month gross at target rates** (Grade 1 $3,000, KG $2,500, Pre-K teacher $2,500, Pre-K assistant $1,000, Qur''an $3,000), about **$13,380/month all-in** with employer taxes and software, **$133,800 over 10 school months**; floor scenario (Grade 1 $2,000, KG $1,000) $9,500 gross / about $10,660 all-in. One board vote covers the monthly run (bylaws: over $5,000 needs two-thirds). Workbook: `records/05_Payroll…/2026-27 Teacher Payroll Budget…xlsx` (updated 2026-09-25, FUTA 0%)', 'Muneeb (President)', '2026-09-30', '2026-09-30', 'Not started', null, now()),
  ('5', 5, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', 'EFTPS: enrolled 2026-09-18 → wait for the PIN letter (home mailbox, ~7 days) → set internet password at eftps.gov → tell Claude', 'Muneeb (accountant)', '2026-09-30', '2026-09-30', 'Waiting', null, now()),
  ('7', 7, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', 'Paid Leave + WA Cares employer account: exists and linked to SAW (found 2026-09-24); PIN letter requested for full access (home mailbox, ~7–10 days) → enter PIN in the Paid Leave portal → tell Claude. Also: note the account/customer ID for `docs/accounts.md`; check whether any past quarters show as due and file zero reports if so', 'Muneeb (accountant)', '2026-10-08', '2026-10-08', 'Waiting', null, now()),
  ('8', 8, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', '**City of Kent business license** applied via FileLocal 2026-09-24 (nonprofit fee exemption requested in the notes; 501(c)(3) letter to be provided if Kent asks). Waiting for Kent to issue the license / City Account Number. Then: save the license PDF to `records/01_Corporate & Legal/03. Registrations & Certificates`, record the FileLocal login in `docs/accounts.md`. State license needs nothing (UI, L&I, tax registration all Active) **Headcount:** application said 4 employees, actual is 5 (all five move to W-2 on 10-01); no fee effect (nonprofit exempt) — give the city 5 if they call, and restate at the Dec 31 renewal', 'Muneeb (President)', '2026-10-15', '2026-10-15', 'Waiting', null, now()),
  ('10', 10, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', '**QBO Payroll set up 2026-09-25 (Claude, in the pane):** Workforce Payroll tier on the 30-day trial ($85/mo after); company + 501(c)(3) type (no FUTA); Form 941, monthly deposits; pay schedule Monthly (end of month), first payday 10-30; **Washington taxes entered** (ESD 1.29% + EAF 0.02%, WA Cares and Paid Leave employee-paid, L&I account, classes 6103-01 / 6104-01 effective 10-01); four of five employees with SOC codes, salaries, sick leave and workers'' comp class; accounting mapping (bank 8048, Teacher Salaries, Payroll Taxes - Employer, liabilities, class Tuition Program). **Bank connected 2026-09-25.** Paused: President needs from the teachers the Qur''an teacher''s legal name + email, the assistant''s email and pay basis. **Then (President):** Finish Up → Done on the team list, e-sign the tax authorization forms, decide the Pre-K assistant''s pay (below minimum wage as salaried), give the Qur''an teacher''s legal name + email and the assistant''s email. Workforce invites to the three teachers went out automatically', 'Muneeb (accountant); bank + e-sign by Muneeb (President)', '2026-10-03', '2026-10-03', 'Waiting', null, now()),
  ('11', 11, false, 'W-2 payroll · B. Registrations', 'Optional: one paid CPA/payroll hour for sign-off; evaluate IRS VCSP (Form 8952) for the 2025 contractor period', 'Muneeb (President)', '2026-10-31', '2026-10-31', 'Not started', null, now()),
  ('12', 12, false, 'W-2 payroll · C. People', 'Per staff member (**five**): W-4, address, SSN and bank details via the **QuickBooks Workforce self-onboarding invite** (three invites go out once the President has connected the bank; two need emails first); I-9 Section 2 in person within 3 business days of Oct 1; class code, rate, sick-leave accrual already in QBO → copies to `records/16_Employees/<person>/02. Tax Forms`. **⚠ Pre-K assistant: $1,000/mo salary at ~104 h/mo is below WA minimum wage — make hourly or adjust before 10-30**', 'Muneeb (Principal)', '2026-10-06', '2026-10-06', 'In progress', null, now()),
