  ('66', 66, false, 'Marketing', '**Entrance signage:** only an 11x17 banner marks the school at Al Huda. Get Al Huda''s OK, then order a portable A-frame or yard sign (about 24x36 in: logo, "Falah Academy", "Mon–Thu 9:00–2:00") for school days; check Kent''s portable-sign rules. While talking to Al Huda: ask them to correct the "Islamic School (Dugsi) Mon–Thu 9:00–1:00" line on alhudaislamiccenter.com/islamic-school (dugsi is weekends) and add a link to falahacademywa.org (was #25). Also photograph the entrance with the banner for the Google cover photo (#24)', 'Muneeb (President), Al Huda admin (Someone else)', 'next school visit', null, 'Parked', null, now()),
  ('67', 67, false, 'Governance', '**File the 2027 WA SOS annual report** (CCFS, UBI 605 907 024; window opens 2026-12-02, expiration 2027-05-31; $20; Express filing works while status is Active). Save the report + receipt to `records/01_Corporate & Legal/03. Registrations & Certificates`', 'Muneeb (President)', '2027-04-30', '2027-04-30', 'Not started', null, now()),
