  ('70', 70, false, 'Website New Feature', '**Admin → Tasks page (this list inside the portal, so any admin can see it):** sortable grid, filter box, "x out of y items" counter, urgency icons, done rows behind a toggle. **Built in dev 2026-09-26** (`Tasks.tsx`, phase 15 table `admin_tasks` with admin-only RLS, `scripts/todo-sync.py` → `admin_tasks_sync.sql`). $0: one table in the existing Supabase project. Rows expand on click for the full task + details. **Live sync:** `todo-sync.py --push dev` / `--push prod` upserts straight into the table using the service key from `~/.falah/supabase.env` (President creates the file once; Claude runs the push after every tracker edit). **Next:** President runs phase 15 in DEV, creates the key file → Claude pushes the rows → President reviews → prod', 'Claude → Muneeb (President) reviews', '2026-10-03', '2026-10-03', 'In progress', null, now()),
